# Dolby Volume Leveler: AudioFlinger (audioserver) reads the leveler control
# props in its mixer thread (native Volume Leveler in Threads.cpp). audioserver
# is coredomain and dolby_audio_prop is a public prop, so reads are already
# permitted; this explicit grant documents the dependency and guards the
# real-time read path against a silent property_get failure.
get_prop(audioserver, dolby_audio_prop)
